<title>USA: Nissan November U.S. car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Nissan November U.S. car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Nov 1-30, 1996     Nov 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    17,295	    19,743	    -12.4</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  11,913	    11,676	     +2.0</p>
<p> Import Car		14,017	    13,859	     +1.1</p>
<p> Import Truck	     8,100	     7,357	    +10.1</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Nov 30, 1996 Jan 1-Nov 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   288,774	   285,925	     +0.3</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 159,650	   168,227	     -5.8</p>
<p> Import Car	     180,867	   198,528	     -9.5</p>
<p> Import Truck	    65,597	    63,239	     +3.0</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 283 for year to date vs 281 in year ago.</p>
</text>
